@node Command and Variable Reference
@chapter Command and Variable Reference
@cindex reference
@cindex command reference
@cindex variable reference

This chapter is the lookup reference for the user-visible surface of
@code{beads.el}.  The task chapters explain how and when to use a
command; this chapter collects the commands, their transient suffixes,
and the user options in one place.  The @ref{Key Index} lists keystrokes
and the @ref{Command and Variable Index} collects the commands and
options alphabetically.

@menu
* Command Reference::
* User Option Reference::
@end menu

@node Command Reference
@section Command Reference
@cindex command reference

Every user-visible @code{beads-defcommand} command and its
auto-generated transient suffix is recorded here, with the keybinding
that reaches it, the equivalent @command{bd} invocation, and the task
chapter that explains it.

@node User Option Reference
@section User Option Reference
@cindex user option reference
@cindex defcustom

Every user option defined in @file{lisp/beads-custom.el} is recorded
here with its default value and its effect on the interface.
